{"parentUuid":"5ff935b2-ea8c-457b-8347-c3b0aeeee743","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim","sessionId":"72d433ec-6330-42b7-944a-0b486d43bf82","version":"2.1.45","gitBranch":"main","slug":"prancy-greeting-snail","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HH4MbVwE4rg9fvLVcYGFSJ","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→import Image from \"next/image\";\n     2→import { AnimatedText } from \"@/components/AnimatedText\";\n     3→import { CLIENTS } from \"@/lib/projects\";\n     4→import type { Metadata } from \"next\";\n     5→\n     6→export const metadata: Metadata = {\n     7→  title: \"About\",\n     8→  description: \"Brand Design Director with 25+ years across Bloomberg, GLG, TIAA, Mastercard, JPMorgan Chase.\",\n     9→};\n    10→\n    11→const BIO_ITEMS = [\n    12→  { label: \"Based\", value: \"New York City\" },\n    13→  { label: \"Experience\", value: \"25+ Years\" },\n    14→  { label: \"Expertise\", value: \"Brand Identity, Systems Design, Event Design, Motion Graphics\" },\n    15→  { label: \"Currently\", value: \"Fractional Creative Director\" },\n    16→  { label: \"Contact\", value: \"JAIME.IBRAHIM@GMAIL.COM\", href: \"mailto:jaime.ibrahim@gmail.com\" },\n    17→];\n    18→\n    19→export default function AboutPage() {\n    20→  return (\n    21→    <div style={{ paddingTop: \"var(--nav-h)\" }}>\n    22→      {/* Hero statement */}\n    23→      <div style={{ maxWidth: \"var(--max-w)\", margin: \"0 auto\", padding: \"clamp(48px, 10vh, 120px) var(--pad) 0\" }}>\n    24→        <AnimatedText\n    25→          text=\"Strategy before aesthetics. Systems over one-offs. Every engagement starts with why a brand needs to exist, not what it should look like.\"\n    26→          as=\"h1\"\n    27→          delay={200}\n    28→          style={{\n    29→            fontSize: \"clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 34px)\", fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.45,\n    30→            letterSpacing: \"-0.01em\", color: \"var(--text)\", maxWidth: 780, margin: 0,\n    31→          }}\n    32→        />\n    33→      </div>\n    34→\n    35→      {/* Portrait + Bio */}\n    36→      <div style={{ maxWidth: \"var(--max-w)\", margin: \"0 auto\", padding: \"clamp(48px, 6vh, 80px) var(--pad)\" }}>\n    37→        <div style={{ display: \"flex\", gap: \"clamp(40px, 6vw, 100px)\", flexWrap: \"wrap\", alignItems: \"flex-start\" }}>\n    38→          {/* Portrait */}\n    39→          <div style={{ flex: \"0 0 clamp(260px, 30vw, 400px)\" }}>\n    40→            <div style={{\n    41→              width: \"100%\", aspectRatio: \"3/4\",\n    42→              borderRadius: \"var(--img-radius)\", position: \"relative\", overflow: \"hidden\",\n    43→            }}>\n    44→              <Image\n    45→                src=\"/images/about/portrait.jpg\"\n    46→                alt=\"Jaime Ibrahim\"\n    47→                fill\n    48→                style={{ objectFit: \"cover\" }}\n    49→                sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 30vw\"\n    50→                priority\n    51→              />\n    52→            </div>\n    53→          </div>\n    54→\n    55→          {/* Bio */}\n    56→          <div style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: 280 }}>\n    57→            <p style={{\n    58→              fontSize: \"clamp(16px, 1.3vw, 18px)\", lineHeight: 1.7, color: \"var(--muted)\",\n    59→              maxWidth: 480, margin: \"0 0 40px\",\n    60→            }}>\n    61→              I&apos;ve spent over two decades shaping how brands look, move, and communicate.\n    62→              That work has always been guided by strategy first, craft second. My projects\n    63→              have spanned brand identity, systems design, environmental and event design,\n    64→              motion, and creative direction — often crossing multiple disciplines within a\n    65→              single engagement. After years leading teams on both the agency and in-house\n    66→              sides, I now work as a fractional creative director.\n    67→            </p>\n    68→            <div style={{ display: \"flex\", flexDirection: \"column\", gap: 24 }}>\n    69→              {BIO_ITEMS.map((item) => (\n    70→                <div key={item.label}>\n    71→                  <div style={{ fontSize: 11, color: \"var(--muted)\", fontWeight: 400, letterSpacing: \"0.08em\", textTransform: \"uppercase\", marginBottom: 6 }}>\n    72→                    {item.label}\n    73→                  </div>\n    74→                  {item.href ? (\n    75→                    <a href={item.href} className=\"link-muted\" style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>\n    76→                      {item.value}\n    77→                    </a>\n    78→                  ) : (\n    79→                    <div style={{ fontSize: 15, color: \"var(--text)\", fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>\n    80→                      {item.value}\n    81→                    </div>\n    82→                  )}\n    83→                </div>\n    84→              ))}\n    85→            </div>\n    86→          </div>\n    87→        </div>\n    88→      </div>\n    89→\n    90→      {/* Brands */}\n    91→      <div style={{ maxWidth: \"var(--max-w)\", margin: \"0 auto\", padding: \"clamp(32px, 4vh, 56px) var(--pad) clamp(48px, 6vh, 80px)\" }}>\n    92→        <h2 style={{ fontSize: 13, color: \"var(--muted)\", fontWeight: 400, margin: \"0 0 20px\", letterSpacing: \"0.06em\", textTransform: \"uppercase\" }}>\n    93→          Brands I&apos;ve Worked With\n    94→        </h2>\n    95→        <div style={{ display: \"flex\", flexWrap: \"wrap\", gap: \"0 32px\" }}>\n    96→          {CLIENTS.map((c) => (\n    97→            <span key={c} style={{ fontSize: \"clamp(15px, 1.2vw, 18px)\", fontWeight: 400, color: \"var(--muted)\", lineHeight: 2.2 }}>\n    98→              {c}\n    99→            </span>\n   100→          ))}\n   101→        </div>\n   102→      </div>\n   103→    </div>\n   104→  );\n   105→}\n   106→"}]},"uuid":"1f4fa806-4711-4747-b74c-8a27cdccd3ec","timestamp":"2026-02-18T00:57:16.324Z"},"normalizedMessages":[],"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"Explore the JaimeIbrahim project codebase thoroughly. I need to understand:\n\n1. The full file structure under src/app/, src/components/, and src/lib/\n2. Where project data is defined (PROJECTS array, year field, client/brands list)\n3. Where nav links are defined (look for \"Thoughts\", \"Instagram\" references)\n4. The thoughts directory structure\n5. Whether there's a next.config file already\n6. Whether there's already a sitemap.ts or robots.ts\n\nSearch for these specific strings across the codebase:\n- \"instagram\" (case insensitive)\n- \"Thoughts\" \n- \"year\" in project data contexts\n- \"Mastercard\" or \"JPMorgan\" or \"Deloitte\" (old brand names)\n- \"sitemap\"\n- \"robots\"\n\nReport the full file tree and the exact locations of all these references with file paths and line numbers.","agentId":"a8e7680"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_01YWhw5DrsTy1xYAMPPisAd1","parentToolUseID":"toolu_01VSnEkBNccRnasKcKYLMNhm","uuid":"60da096e-c5f9-4480-91a0-ac193ce6c051","timestamp":"2026-02-18T00:57:16.433Z"}
