          <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"1.5\">\n    34→            <path d=\"M8 1L2 7L8 13\" />\n    35→          </svg>\n    36→          Thoughts\n    37→        </Link>\n    38→\n    39→        <span style={{ fontSize: 11, color: \"var(--muted-light)\", letterSpacing: \"0.08em\", textTransform: \"uppercase\", display: \"block\", marginBottom: 16 }}>\n    40→          {article.date}\n    41→        </span>\n    42→\n    43→        <h1 style={{ fontSize: \"clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 48px)\", fontWeight: 400, letterSpacing: \"-0.02em\", color: \"var(--text)\", margin: \"0 0 clamp(32px, 4vh, 48px)\", lineHeight: 1.15 }}>\n    44→          {article.title}\n    45→        </h1>\n    46→\n    47→        <div style={{ width: 40, height: 1, background: \"var(--border)\", marginBottom: \"clamp(32px, 4vh, 48px)\" }} />\n    48→\n    49→        <div style={{ fontSize: \"clamp(16px, 1.3vw, 18px)\", lineHeight: 1.75 }}>\n    50→          {paragraphs.map((p, i) => (\n    51→            <p key={i} style={{ margin: \"0 0 28px\", color: i === 0 ? \"var(--text)\" : \"var(--muted)\" }}>\n    52→              {p}\n    53→            </p>\n    54→          ))}\n    55→        </div>\n    56→      </div>\n    57→    </div>\n    58→  );\n    59→}\n    60→"}]},"uuid":"f535b775-6cd5-4618-810b-8f7874cf009d","timestamp":"2026-02-18T00:57:18.695Z"},"normalizedMessages":[],"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"Explore the JaimeIbrahim project codebase thoroughly. I need to understand:\n\n1. The full file structure under src/app/, src/components/, and src/lib/\n2. Where project data is defined (PROJECTS array, year field, client/brands list)\n3. Where nav links are defined (look for \"Thoughts\", \"Instagram\" references)\n4. The thoughts directory structure\n5. Whether there's a next.config file already\n6. Whether there's already a sitemap.ts or robots.ts\n\nSearch for these specific strings across the codebase:\n- \"instagram\"