{"parentUuid":"bfc509fe-db10-4406-a0bf-d15988e1855c","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim","sessionId":"72d433ec-6330-42b7-944a-0b486d43bf82","version":"2.1.45","gitBranch":"main","slug":"prancy-greeting-snail","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"assistant","timestamp":"2026-02-18T00:57:18.834Z","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01GAF65B1Q8kHCXGt8SSQo64","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01L7UCqAKngBgARpwnrRbnBx","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/c/Users/User/JaimeIbrahim/src/lib/article-content.ts"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3844,"cache_read_input_tokens":60378,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3844},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"requestId":"req_011CYEdFaveKy1agzcrxSySe","uuid":"750ca3b4-7a93-4fb6-a105-67b358438686"},"normalizedMessages":[],"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"Explore the JaimeIbrahim project codebase thoroughly. I need to understand:\n\n1. The full file structure under src/app/, src/components/, and src/lib/\n2. Where project data is defined (PROJECTS array, year field, client/brands list)\n3. Where nav links are defined (look for \"Thoughts\", \"Instagram\" references)\n4. The thoughts directory structure\n5. Whether there's a next.config file already\n6. Whether there's already a sitemap.ts or robots.ts\n\nSearch for these specific strings across the codebase:\n- \"instagram\" (case insensitive)\n- \"Thoughts\" \n- \"year\" in project data contexts\n- \"Mastercard\" or \"JPMorgan\" or \"Deloitte\" (old brand names)\n- \"sitemap\"\n- \"robots\"\n\nReport the full file tree and the exact locations of all these references with file paths and line numbers.","agentId":"a8e7680"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_01YWhw5DrsTy1xYAMPPis