{"parentUuid":"214ebc1d-e46b-4640-81b2-14e46fba9e15","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim","sessionId":"72d433ec-6330-42b7-944a-0b486d43bf82","version":"2.1.45","gitBranch":"main","slug":"prancy-greeting-snail","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012U5stWuK6wTXKe1KJYg74k","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→import styles from \"./PlaceholderImage.module.css\";\n     2→\n     3→interface PlaceholderImageProps {\n     4→  color: string;\n     5→  title: string;\n     6→  height?: number | string;\n     7→  style?: React.CSSProperties;\n     8→}\n     9→\n    10→export function PlaceholderImage({ color, title, height = 380, style }: PlaceholderImageProps) {\n    11→  return (\n    12→    <div\n    13→      className={styles.container}\n    14→      style={{ background: color, height, ...style }}\n    15→    >\n    16→      <div className={styles.pattern} />\n    17→      <span className={styles.label}>{title}</span>\n    18→    </div>\n    19→  );\n    20→}\n    21→"}]},"uuid":"a8d3d603-5973-4e09-8774-53b9698439d1","timestamp":"2026-02-18T01:06:23.682Z"},"normalizedMessages":[],"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"I need to do a holistic audit of the jaimeibrahim.com portfolio site after completing major revisions. The site is a Next.js 15 App Router portfolio for a Brand Design Director.\n\nRead these key files to understand the current state:\n- C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim\\src\\app\\layout.tsx (root layout)\n- C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim\\src\\app\\page.tsx (homepage)\n- C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim\\src\\app\\work\\page.tsx (work index)\n- C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim\\src\\app\\work\\[slug]\\page.tsx (project detail)\n- C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim\\src\\app\\about\\page.tsx (about page)\n- C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim\\src\\app\\not-found.tsx (404 page)\n- C:\\Users\\User\\JaimeIbrahim\\src\\app\\globals.css (global styles)\n- C:\\Users\\User