mepage** — Hiring manager has to navigate to About, then scroll to find the email.\n\n## Nice-to-have (polish)\n\n12. Category filter state lost on back-navigation (use URL params)\n13. 404 page says \"Back to Work\" but links to `/`\n14. Mobile menu doesn't trap focus or close on Escape\n15. Weather API re-fetches on every navigation (no caching)\n16. Inline styles on page files (about, work/[slug], homepage) — should be CSS Modules per spec\n17. No downloadable resume/CV for a fractional CD portfolio\n18. `isActive` nav logic treats homepage as \"Work\" active state\n\n---\n\nNow let me make that favicon."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7738,"cache_read_input_tokens":111009,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7738},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYEe7wER63T6sDfN9jmfz","type":"assistant","uuid":"fb1e3a47-ab8a-4a95-9308-f7f357f2c691","timestamp":"2026-02-18T01:08:59.380Z"}
