eploy hook (\"CLI_Deploy\", hook ID: HkuXWI4Zz3)\n   - Pipeline: Claude Code → GitButler → GitHub (JosephOIbrahim/JaimeIbrahim, private) → Vercel (Jaime's account)\n   - Vercel project ID: `prj_z74lBi7RngGXr9vnpznjY4jMbCI7`, team: `team_kUg2EW3mVXtPaGGMJAnVjcMH`\n   - `next/og` ImageResponse for OG image generation\n   - LCP optimization via `priority` prop on hero images\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - **`src/components/GridCard.tsx`**\n     - Core grid card component. Removed `project.year` metatag, added `priority` prop for LCP, changed image alt to `project.heroAlt || project.title`, scaled image height with CSS var `--height-scale`\n     ```tsx\n     interface GridCardProps {\n       project: Project;\n       showText: boolean;\n       height: number;\n       columnIndex?: number;\n       priority?: boolean;\n     }\n     // Image height now uses CSS calc for responsive scaling:\n     <div style={{ position: \"relative\", width: \"100%\", height: `calc(${height}px * var(--height-scale, 1))` }}>\n       <Image src={hero} alt={project.heroAlt || project.title} fill priority={priority} ... />\n     ```\n\n   - **`src/components/Nav.tsx`**\n     - Removed \"Thoughts\" from NAV_LINKS, removed Instagram from SOCIAL_LINKS, added `aria-expanded={mobileOpen}` to hamburger button, added Escape key handler to close mobile menu\n     ```tsx\n     const NAV_LINKS = [\n       { href: \"/work\", label: \"Work\" },\n       { href: \"/about\", label: \"About\" },\n     ] as const;\n     const SOCIAL_LINKS = [\n       { label: \"LinkedIn\", href: \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaimeibrahim/\" },\n     ] as const;\n     // Added Escape key handler:\n     useEffect(() => {\n       if (!mobileOpen) return;\n       const handler = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\n         if (e.key === \"Escape\") setMobileOpen(false);\n       };\n       document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", handler);\n       return () => document.removeEventListener(\"keydown\", handler);\n     }, [mobileOpen]);\n     ```\n\n   - **`src/components/Nav.module.css`**\n     - Changed mobile breakpoint from 480px to 640px\n     ```css\n     @media (max-width: 640px) { /* was 480px */ }\n     ```\n\n   - **`src/components/Footer.tsx`**\n     - Removed Instagram link and InstagramIcon SVG constant, kept LinkedIn only\n\n   - **`src/lib/projects.ts`**\n     - Removed `Thought` import, removed `THOUGHTS` array (dead code), updated `CLIENTS` array to new 12-brand list, added `heroAlt` field to 9 projects\n     ```typescript\n     export const CLIENTS = [\n       \"Bloomberg\", \"GLG\", \"TIAA\", \"American Express\", \"Martha Stewart\", \"Bailard\",\n       \"JC Flowers\", \"Johnson & Johnson\", \"Sony BMG\", \"Simon & Schuster\", \"Viacom\", \"Scholastic\",\n     ] as const;\n     ```\n\n   - **`src/lib/types.ts`**\n     - Added `heroAlt?: string` to Project interface, removed `Thought` interface (dead code)\n\n   - **`src/lib/tokens.ts`**\n     - Updated `mutedLight` from `'#999999'` to `'#757575'` for WCAG AA compliance\n\n   - **`src/app/layout.tsx`**\n     - Updated metadata description with new brand names, added JSON-LD Person schema in `<head>`, imported GoogleAnalytics component, replaced inline skip-link styles with CSS class `skip-link`\n     ```tsx\n     <a href=\"#main-content\" className=\"skip-link\">Skip to content</a>\n     ```\n\n   - **`src/app/globals.css`**\n     - Changed `--muted-light` from `#999999` to `#757575`, added `.skip-link` and `.skip-link:focus-visible` styles\n     ```css\n     .skip-link:focus-visible {\n       position: fixed; top: 8px; left: 8px; width: auto; height: auto;\n       overflow: visible; padding: 8px 16px; background: var(--text);\n       color: var(--bg); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;\n       letter-spacing: 0.04em; border-radius: 4px;\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - **`src/app/sitemap.ts`**\n     - Removed `/thoughts` and thought pages, removed `THOUGHTS` import, bumped project priority to 0.8\n\n   - **`src/app/work/layout.tsx`** (NEW